/ evidence-triples (key 0) is present, but its only evidence-triple-record /
/ omits the mandatory measurement-map list, leaving a 1-element array.      /
/ zcbor backtracks the whole member and the `* int => any` extension entry  /
/ swallows key 0, so ev-triples-map decodes as if it were empty. The parser /
/ must report a malformed member rather than an absent one.                 /
571({
  / ev-triples / 0: {
    / evidence-triples / 0: [
      [
        / environment-map / {
          / class / 0: { / vendor / 1: "TestVendor", / model / 2: "TestModel" }
        }
        / mandatory [ 1*50 measurement-map ] omitted here /
      ]
    ]
  }
})
